Subject: CPMS I03C Semantic Residual Registry Data Design

@ [design_uuid] efabd12a-7798-43ab-a320-edec7c32e0c3

& [ResidualRegistry] contains
  + profile String fixed cantor-semantic-residual-registry/0.1
  + parent_specification_uuid String
  + i02_bundle_bytes u64 fixed 247809
  + i02_bundle_artifact_digest ContentDigest fixed SHA256 03616F46C4A3C4B7FA4B9D0A668E16FF4B47BA71CB70879B10F1D95157ADCB42
  + i02_payload_digest ContentDigest fixed SHA256 34f580f21825860ec03ed0bd089ab2b34ae8c08dd1d8cb66f22a629750314167
  + i02_exact_baseline_fingerprint ContentDigest fixed SHA256 77668e20c701723929cb9b12343ed33b21ee1f59da5ea121db3d0e0be94ba6d7
  + source_snapshots Vec CodeSnapshot sorted by repository_path
  + records Vec SemanticResidualRecord in exact baseline order
  + indexes ResidualRegistryIndexes
  + registry_digest ContentDigest

& [SemanticResidualRecord] contains
  + id ResidualId
  + title String
  + class ResidualClass
  + covered_roots Vec MachineSchemaRootKind sorted by enum order
  + subject_types Vec String sorted bytewise
  + applicability ResidualPredicate
  + stages Vec ResidualStage sorted by enum order
  + code_bindings Vec CodeBinding sorted by crate module function identity
  + enforcement EnforcementDisposition
  + evaluation_policy I03EvaluationPolicy
  + severity ResidualSeverity
  + proof_references Vec String sorted bytewise
  + related Vec ResidualRelation sorted by kind then target id
  + rationale String

& [ResidualId] is exact validated ASCII text matching RMS-R0[1-6] or I03-R0(0[7-9]|1[0-9]|20)
& [ResidualClass] is capacity semantic_structure integrity lineage authority replay result_shape or non_capability
& [ResidualStage] is byte_ingress deserialize semantic_validation preparation authorship authorship_replay coordination_replay tool_schema tool_call controller_verification controller_replay admission or bounded_execution
& [EnforcementDisposition] is enforced partially_enforced unimplemented observational or outside_i03
& [I03EvaluationPolicy] is safe_pure observational_only or prohibited_authority
& [ResidualSeverity] is informational release_blocking or authority_blocking
& [ResidualRelationKind] is depends_on overlaps supersedes split_from or guarded_by

& [ResidualPredicate] is a closed declarative expression
  + always
  + reaches_admission
  + pass_index_has_successor_capacity
  + proposal_evaluated_for_execution
  + result_or_transcript_is_verified
  + no predicate executes code or accepts arbitrary expression text

& [CodeSnapshot] contains repository_path String bytes u64 sha256 ContentDigest and baseline_commit String
& [InternalCodeBinding] contains crate_name module_path function_names Vec String and snapshot_index u64
& [ExternalCodeBinding] contains package_name locked_version feature_set Vec String observed_concept String and stability external_observation
& [CodeBinding] is internal or external

& [ResidualRelation] contains kind ResidualRelationKind and target ResidualId
& [ResidualRegistryIndexes] contains deterministic maps
  + by_root MachineSchemaRootKind to Vec ResidualId
  + by_subject_type String to Vec ResidualId
  + by_disposition EnforcementDisposition to Vec ResidualId
  + by_stage ResidualStage to Vec ResidualId
  + by_module_function String to Vec ResidualId where key is crate double-colon module double-colon function
  + by_proof_reference String to Vec ResidualId

