& [BaselineRecordAssignments] are exact
  + RMS-R01 roots all stages deserialize disposition partially_enforced policy observational_only proof future_i03_typed_reader_capacity
  + RMS-R02 roots all stages semantic_validation disposition enforced policy safe_pure proof crates/cantor_core/tests/procedure_validation.rs
  + RMS-R03 roots all stages semantic_validation disposition enforced policy safe_pure proof crates/cantor_core/tests/procedure_validation.rs
  + RMS-R04 roots all stages semantic_validation disposition enforced policy safe_pure proof crates/cantor_core/tests/procedure_validation.rs
  + RMS-R05 roots all stages semantic_validation disposition partially_enforced policy safe_pure proof crates/cantor_core/tests/procedure_validation.rs and future_i03_cross_reader_account_correspondence
  + RMS-R06 roots all stages admission disposition outside_i03 policy prohibited_authority proof crates/cantor_core/tests/procedure_verifier.rs
