  + I03-R011 roots run_input verify_input base_response preparation_response stages authorship coordination_replay disposition enforced policy safe_pure proof procedure_authorship and procedure_coordination tests
  + I03-R012 roots run_input verify_input base_response preparation_response stages tool_schema disposition enforced policy safe_pure proof crates/cantor_core/tests/procedure_tool.rs
  + I03-R013 roots run_input verify_input base_response preparation_response stages tool_call disposition enforced policy safe_pure proof crates/cantor_core/tests/procedure_tool.rs
  + I03-R014 roots run_input verify_input base_response preparation_response stages tool_call disposition enforced policy safe_pure proof crates/cantor_core/tests/procedure_tool.rs
  + I03-R015 roots run_input verify_input base_response preparation_response stages authorship tool_call disposition enforced policy safe_pure proof procedure_authorship and procedure_tool tests
  + I03-R016 roots verify_input base_response preparation_response stages controller_verification disposition enforced policy safe_pure proof crates/cantor_core/tests/procedure_tool.rs
  + I03-R017 roots verify_input base_response preparation_response stages controller_verification disposition enforced policy safe_pure proof crates/cantor_core/tests/procedure_tool.rs
  + I03-R018 roots verify_input base_response preparation_response stages controller_verification disposition enforced policy safe_pure proof crates/cantor_core/tests/procedure_tool.rs
  + I03-R019 roots verify_input base_response stages controller_replay disposition enforced policy safe_pure proof crates/cantor_core/tests/procedure_tool.rs
  + I03-R020 roots all stages bounded_execution controller_verification disposition enforced policy observational_only proof crates/cantor_core/tests/procedure_tool.rs and future_i03c_source_surface_non_capability

& [DigestPreimage] is UTF-8 canonical length-prefixed fields
  * ASCII domain cantor-semantic-residual-registry/0.1
  * parent specification UUID
  * I02 bundle byte length artifact digest embedded payload digest and embedded exact-baseline fingerprint
  * source snapshots in path order
  * records in registry order
  * indexes in field then key order
  + every scalar and collection has an explicit tag and u64 length
  + SHA256 over preimage yields registry_digest

& [QueryResult] contains profile query digest matched residual ids and exact cloned records
  + no function pointer callback admission token or mutable registry reference

& [DesignDisposition] is exact_candidate_forms_not_implemented
